    \label{fig:mbqc_ff}
\end{figure}

Graphix provides an interface with the circuit model by implementing a circuit-to-pattern transpiler and an \qasm 3.0 exporter to convert a pattern to a circuit with ancillas and classical control. Further, it also implements the circuit extraction algorithm presented in Ref.~\cite{Simmons21} which extracts a pattern's underlying unitary transformation if it exists and compiles it into a circuit without ancillas or feed-forward (see Box \ref{box:pattern_transpilation} and Section~\ref{subsec:from_to_circuits} for an in-depth discussion).\\

